                <invention-title lang="de">ELEKTRONISCHE VORRICHTUNG, VERFAHREN UND COMPUTERLESBARES SPEICHERMEDIUM ZUR VERWALTUNG DER ÜBERTRAGUNG AN EINE EXTERNE ELEKTRONISCHE VORRICHTUNG IN EINER DRAHTLOSEN UMGEBUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF ÉLECTRONIQUE, PROCÉDÉ ET SUPPORT D'INFORMATIONS LISIBLE PAR ORDINATEUR POUR GÉRER UNE TRANSMISSION À UN DISPOSITIF ÉLECTRONIQUE EXTERNE DANS UN ENVIRONNEMENT SANS FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ELECTRONIC DEVICE, METHOD, AND COMPUTER READABLE STORAGE MEDIUM FOR MANAGING TRANSMISSION TO EXTERNAL ELECTRONIC DEVICE WITHIN WIRELESS ENVIRONMENT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electronic device according to one embodiment may comprise at least one processor configured to: establish a first communication link between the electronic device and a first external electronic device, using the communication circuitry; establish a second communication link between the electronic device and a second external electronic device, using the communication circuitry; based on the first and second communication links, generate a connected isochronous group (CIG) event including a first connected isochronous stream (CIS) event and a second CIS event that at least partially overlap with each other in accordance with a first arrangement of CIS events; communicate, with the first external electronic device, via the first CIS event included in the CIG event, using the communication circuitry; and communicate, with the second external electronic device, via the second CIS event included in the CIG event, using the communication circuitry.</p>
            </abstract>
